# ACL del bus interno (contracts/mqtt-topics.md). Todo lo no listado está prohibido,
# incluido sim/#, que solo existe en la laptop.

# Cada servicio anuncia solo su propio estado (y su Last Will).
pattern write svc/%u/status

user trigger
topic read gate/verdict
topic read gate/state
topic write gate/trigger

user capture
topic read gate/trigger
topic write gate/frames_ready
topic write gate/fault
topic write camera/status

# El ÚNICO que puede ordenar abrir.
user uplink
topic read gate/frames_ready
topic write gate/command
topic write gate/verdict

# El único que publica el estado de la pluma.
user gate
topic read gate/command
topic write gate/state
topic write gate/fault

user health
topic read svc/+/status
topic read gate/#
topic read camera/status
topic write health/summary
